{"scene_id": "s00602", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00602.fountain", "heading": "EXT. GLASS MOUNTAIN SUMMIT - DAWN", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ALBERICH THORNE", "names": ["ALBERICH THORNE", "ALBERICH"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 1, "name": "THISTLE", "names": ["THISTLE"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 8}, {"id": 2, "name": "UMBRA", "names": ["UMBRA"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 10}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. GLASS MOUNTAIN SUMMIT - DAWN", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A peak sheathed in clear ice, like a vast frozen waterfall caught mid-fall.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "The sky is pearl.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Wind has polished everything.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "At the top, a small level shelf, and on it a stone table.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "ALBERICH THORNE, 70s, wizard, in grey robes pinned with a hundred small brass keys, sits on a stool cut from a single block of ice, warming his hands over a bowl of coals.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Across the table, THISTLE, 20s, an apprentice with wild ginger hair and a scorched apron, polishes a copper kettle.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "And above them both, coiled around the mountain's crest, the vast pale body of UMBRA, a dragon of smoke and fog, one great lamplike eye half-open, listening.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thistle. The tea.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not ready.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You said that an hour ago.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was true an hour ago.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Children. Please.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["a low rumble, almost fond"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We are not children.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We are not children.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then stop quarrelling like them.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Thistle sets down the kettle.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Alberich blows on his hands.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "The dragon shifts, scattering a rain of frost that glitters before it settles on the table.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Umbra, how long will the mountain hold?", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "As long as I breathe on it.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And how long is that?", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A thousand years, if left alone.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We've never left you alone.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I noticed.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You like the company.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I like the tea. The company is a price.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody can pay that price in tea.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["muttering, to the kettle"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I heard that.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You were meant to.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Alberich laughs, a dry papery chuckle that turns into a cough.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Thistle stops what she is doing and pours water into the cup, steady, and holds it to his mouth while he drinks, and Umbra watches them both with the mild patience of a creature that has seen many wizards and many apprentices and learned that they all fall into the same small rhythm of kindness and complaint, and that the rhythm is, in the end, the only magic worth keeping.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you, child.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm twenty-three.", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Child.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Master, the wind is turning. Shall I close the sky?", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not yet. Let us finish the tea.", "name": "ALBERICH", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Thistle pours three cups: two porcelain, one a bucket.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "She sets the bucket at the edge of the shelf.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Umbra lowers its huge head and sips, the fog around its jaw steaming.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mm.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Too hot?", "name": "THISTLE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Just right.", "name": "UMBRA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "The sun clears the horizon.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Light breaks across the ice, a thousand mirrors lit at once.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "None of them speak.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Wind and tea and morning.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}